  "note": "New export ./listing/read-only (src/listing/read-only-verifier.mjs, with its limits in src/listing/read-only-limits.mjs): createReadOnlyListingVerifier checks one exact Listing for display through its own Directory client and pinned testnet chain reader per call, with at most nine requests, a 15 s call deadline, 2 s per request and byte caps half the reader defaults, and refuses with ReadOnlyListingError (code listing_read_unavailable and one fixed reason, no cause). The Directory client gains a detailMaxBytes option, and the chain reader identityMaxBytes and storageMaxBytes options, forwarded by createDemosPublicChainReader; their defaults are unchanged. The manifest export changes the gate's pinned manifest, so the hold pair is re-pinned."
